      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Questionnaires on the nature of pain were distributed among 100 female postoperative and 29 incurable patients suffering from genital tumors. The structure of an acute and a chronic pain syndrome was established. The postoperative pain syndrome appeared to be determined, mainly, by the site and extent of surgical intervention while the chronic one by the pattern of tumor progression."},
